        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKtfQQmUX2DbsbQT4o_PZhhGQkW8aTj43tIHRfnj8hWoCpAdw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Highly recommend! She is a professional Chinese massage therapist who masters both Thai and Chinese techniques. Her pressure is precise and effective, and she knows exactly how to relieve pain in the right spots. I walked out feeling lighter and fully relaxed.",
        "time": 1764456230,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Menglin LIN",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116336592771232290418/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKxtyIt7Qqmzt4QAf79F9qlIUv8jFZ3EkMcBxBm21xmHPfNHc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very professional and highly recommended ! I have an excellent experience with the studio, really impressed by the client-tailored service and the passion of the owner.  They take care of my neck, shoulder and back with Thai massage, foot reflexology and cupping. I used to have lots of pain and I was greatly relaxed after one session. Definitely will come back again.",
        "time": 1763433850,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dalia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103791030212687419101/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwmOUZRdlH4OxSe_j_AjJCXlMhvuChtrQVIES3ehQMYSWRxw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had an excellent experience!\nBooked a reflexology foot massage and it was beyond any expectations I had.\nI walked out feeling lighter and very relaxed. Not to mention Mengyan’s extra care, offering me a mask while she was performing the message. I am coming back!",
        "time": 1765146534,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yuyu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106900367317785569898/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnaOH8FgasWECO97nJuB0LZgn9s1JNL7AIwFJBLE-5kcDV4fE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I’m someone who loves sports and often struggles with tense muscles. After getting a Thai massage here, I felt completely relaxed and refreshed. It was a wonderful experience that really helped release my muscle tension. Highly recommend!",
